# TestJavaToKotlinGuavaNullability: guava printed as Kotlin with NullabilityPass (KOTLIN) verdicts, judged by kotlinc
# 2.4.0 (see maddi-run-openjdk's JavaToKotlinRatchet). Lower is better for printerCrashes and syntaxErrors, higher for
# syntaxCleanFiles, compilingFiles, bytecodeFiles, testsPassing, testBytecodeFiles and translatedTestsPassing; `types`
# must not move. Write a better value here in the commit that earns it.
